---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
const posts=(await getCollection('writeups',({data})=>data.published)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.date.valueOf()-a.data.date.valueOf());
---
<Base><div class="shell"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">// OFFENSIVE SECURITY · OSCP JOURNEY</p><h1>Breaking things.<br/><em>Understanding</em><br/>why.</h1><p class="lede">I'm <strong>Zakaria Adili</strong>, aka <strong>DEV11</strong> — an aspiring penetration tester documenting my journey through ethical hacking, research and hands-on labs.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/writeups">EXPLORE WRITE-UPS ↗</a><a class="button" href="#about">ABOUT ME ↓</a></div></div><div class="terminal"><div class="terminal-head">● ● ● <span>zakaria@lab:~</span></div><div class="terminal-body"><p><b>❯</b> whoami</p><p class="green">zakaria_adili</p><p><b>❯</b> cat focus.txt</p><p class="muted">[+] Penetration testing<br/>[+] Linux & web exploitation<br/>[+] Active Directory<br/>[+] OSCP preparation</p><p><b>❯</b> echo $MINDSET</p><p>learn → test → document → repeat</p><p><b>❯</b> _</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">// FIELD NOTES</p><h2>Recent write-ups<span class="green">.</span></h2><p class="muted">Real lessons from authorized labs, including mistakes and guided solutions.</p><div class="cards">{posts.slice(0,3).map(post=><a class="card" href={'/writeups/'+post.id}><div class="tags">{post.data.platform} · {post.data.difficulty} · {post.data.status}</div><h3>{post.data.title}</h3><p>{post.data.summary}</p><span class="green">READ WRITE-UP ↗</span></a>)}</div><a class="link" href="/writeups">VIEW ALL WRITE-UPS ↗</a></section><section class="section columns" id="about"><div><p class="eyebrow">// ABOUT ME</p><h2>Curiosity is the starting point.</h2><p>I'm studying toward the OSCP and building practical skills through hands-on exercises. This portfolio records what I learned, not a claim of certifications I haven't earned.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">// CURRENT FOCUS</p><div class="skills"><span>LINUX</span><span>WEB SECURITY</span><span>PRIVILEGE ESCALATION</span><span>ACTIVE DIRECTORY</span><span>ENUMERATION</span><span>PYTHON / BASH</span></div></div></section><section class="section" id="contact"><p class="eyebrow">// CONNECT</p><h2>Let's talk security.</h2><p class="muted">Explore my projects and connect through GitHub.</p><a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/zakadili" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GITHUB PROFILE ↗</a></section></div></Base>